==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Unicycle Cat (Enemy)|Unicycle Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 14.67~22 seconds<sup>440f~660f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A good way to beat this stage is to spam [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] ([[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], etc.) and spawn a [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] (at least 15 or above). Although, you can also just spam [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] as well.

